<title>USA: AccuStaff buys Preferred Consulting.</title>
<headline>AccuStaff buys Preferred Consulting.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>AccuStaff Inc said on Wednesday it bought Preferred Consulting Services Inc, a St. Paul, Minn., information technology services firm.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement was not disclosed.</p>
<p>Preferred has focused on providing services in the mainframe, PC and client-server environments to deliver information systems solutions for its clients.  Its 1996 estimated revenues are about $10 million, AccuStaff said.</p>
<p>AccuStaff said it has bought six companies, adding $113 million to its total revenues, since the beginning of the year.</p>
</text>
